    "en-US": "Short narrative lives of the saints from the Catholic Truth Society's devotional pamphlet series — each a single authored biography written to inspire rather than catalogue. Drawn from the CTS booklets digitized at ecatholic2000.com; sermons, Marian doctrine, and novena booklets from the same series are omitted.",
